config I2S_LOONGSON_LS2K0300
	bool "Loongson 2K0300 I2S driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_LOONGSON_LS2K0300_I2S_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the Loongson 2K0300 I2S controller ("IIS", user manual chapter
	  11) as a stereo, I2S format, master or slave controller.

	  The driver is polled: this port has no DMA controller driver, so the
	  two 8 byte FIFOs are fed one 32 bit word at a time, paced from the
	  system cycle counter. i2s_write() therefore blocks for the duration of
	  the buffer, and both directions have to be serviced from the same
	  thread. The transmit and receive interrupts of the block stay disabled
	  - they report FIFO overflow/underflow, which cannot be used as a pacing
	  signal.
